@startuml use-case
left to right direction
skinparam actorStyle awesome
title UI5 Konnektor SOAP Frontend — Use Cases

actor "Technician / Integrator" as User

rectangle "ui5-conn-frontend" {
  usecase "Browse services (tiles)" as UC1
  usecase "Open service client" as UC2
  usecase "List service main entity" as UC3
  usecase "Invoke operation via dialog" as UC4
  usecase "Edit request (form view)" as UC5
  usecase "Edit request (raw XML view)" as UC6
  usecase "Toggle form <-> raw XML" as UC7
  usecase "Inspect response / SOAP fault" as UC8
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
UC2 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
User --> UC4
UC4 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC8 : <<include>>
UC5 <--> UC7
UC6 <--> UC7
UC7 ..> UC6 : <<extend>>
UC4 ..> UC3 : <<extend>>\n(refresh on mutation)

note bottom of UC4
  Operations call konnektor SOAP
  services same-origin (/ws/conn/*)
end note
@enduml
